The copy was cut from upstream commit 12f0483c373b7779dc20bbda020f99915de05c97
(version 0.16.25-DEV). Trixi.jl-fsbp.diff lists every modification made for the
accompanying paper as one patch against that commit. In a git clone of this
repository, the root commit holds the upstream tree unchanged, and every later
commit touching Trixi.jl/ is one of those modifications:

    git log --oneline -- Trixi.jl

The FSBP operator tables in scripts/elixirs/fsbp_ops_*.jl were generated with
FSBP.jl, the authors' operator-construction package, which is not public. Each
file's header names the generating script.

